   {
    "id": "x2",
    "text": "Stage 1: gain 1 + 10k/10k = 2 (non-inverting).\nStage 2: gain -20k/10k = -2 (inverting).\nOverall -4: 0.5 V in becomes -2 V out. Probe IN, MID and OUT.",
